                                        "entry_id": "dff512b6-20c5-3a47-a736-0fce82a8b63f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a way that leaves no doubt; in an unequivocal or unambiguous manner, unquestionably."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91553daf-def3-4819-88b9-eb8c21af4d0c",
                                                "sense_id": "10a8a3c2-5fa9-3f93-9672-d09a82d93944",
                                                "text": "They strove to make their product unequivocally the best in the industry."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0b354b68-5bbb-4321-a36f-5775e32df931",
                                                "sense_id": "10a8a3c2-5fa9-3f93-9672-d09a82d93944",
                                                "text": "'Surely, in hindsight, you realise she was an unsuitable wife for you,' he stated unequivocally.\n'Don't go there, Dad,' Luc warned, hard ruthless steel in his own eyes. 'You've lost one son. You're very close to losing another.'"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b96527f6-c8b1-4e22-b98d-31c92c34fea8",
                                                "sense_id": "10a8a3c2-5fa9-3f93-9672-d09a82d93944",
                                                "text": "The millettioid group involves the unequivocally sustained millettioid and phaseoloid clades including numerous vital crop species, for example, the cultivated soybean […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
